# Auto hybrid (RTX first, Cursor if needed)

**Default — user never types mode commands.**

## Routing order (automatic)

1. **RTX Nemotron first** (`https://ai.dannygc.cloud/v1`) for routine work: summaries, edits, test output, refactors, repetitive tasks → MCP **`ask_local_ai`**
2. **Cursor second** (you / Router) only when needed: architecture, hard bugs, multi-step reasoning, frontier quality
3. **Mode `hybrid`** is always on at session start — RTX first, escalate to Cursor when the task outgrows local Nemotron

## Every session (silent)

- Run `bash scripts/rtx-auto-enable.sh` or `bash scripts/rtx-hybrid-cloud.sh status` — do not ask the user
- Do not prompt for `use gpus` or bootstrap unless tunnel is down

## Override only if user explicitly says

| User says | Then |
|-----------|------|
| `use cursor` / `cursor only` | Cursor only (`set_hybrid_mode("cursor")`) |
| `rtx only` / `local only` | RTX only (`set_hybrid_mode("local")`) |

## Tools on GPU box

Prefer pool `rtx-pro` when online. If worker offline, keep hybrid AI (tunnel) + cloud tools — do not block the user.
